<aside class="sidebar"><section class="profile-card glass-card"><div class="profile-cover" aria-hidden="true"><span>STAY HUNGRY, STAY CURIOUS.</span></div><img class="profile-avatar" src="<%- url_for('/assets/burger.jpg') %>" width="76" height="76" alt="双层鳕鱼堡头像"><span class="mini-label">HELLO, I'M</span><h3>双层鳕鱼堡</h3><p>代码、谜题，还有一份刚出炉的好奇心。</p><div class="profile-stats"><a href="<%- url_for('/writeups/') %>"><strong><%= blog().posts.length %></strong><span>篇记录</span></a><a href="<%- url_for('/categories/') %>"><strong>6</strong><span>个方向</span></a></div><a class="profile-github" href="<%= config.github %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%- icon('github') %> @<%= config.github_username %><%- icon('diagonal') %></a></section><section class="glass-card direction-card"><span class="mini-label">PICK YOUR FLAVOR</span><h3>按方向加餐</h3><div class="direction-list"><% blog().directions.forEach(direction => { %><a class="direction-link" href="<%- url_for(`/categories/${direction.name}/`) %>"><span><%- icon(direction.icon) %><%= direction.label %></span><small><%= String(direction.count).padStart(2,'0') %></small></a><% }) %></div></section><div class="small-note"><%- icon('spark') %><p>遇到有趣的问题，<br>就多拆开看一层。</p></div></aside>
